close all
use encryhdr
go top

Do while Not EOF()
	l_string=encryptdhd
	passkey=alltrim(decrypt("10420064205741955417684198938333969393539353714"))
	decstr=decwkey(l_string, passkey, 1,2)
	*wait window decstr
	&decstr
	skip
ENDDO
close all
*wait window header1
*wait window header2
*wait window header3
*wait window header4
*wait window header5